    P31 --> P33["3.3 Entity, Landmark & Hazard Extraction"]
    P31 --> P34["3.4 VADER Sentiment Polarity"]
    
    P32 & P33 & P34 --> P35["3.5 Multi-Factor Priority Score Formulation (0-100)"]
